ext\", \"q\": \"Analyses were conducted using SAS (version 9.4; SAS Institute).\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Data not displayed because the numbers were too small to be meaningful.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}